   "op": "para",
   "text": "CONTAINS: 4 private API symbols from HearingUtilities, PersonalAudio. Captures all system audio through a Core Audio process tap and processes it on your Mac. Nothing is recorded or sent anywhere. Background Sounds and Headphone Accommodations controls use private macOS settings classes, which may change in future macOS versions.",
